      {
        "widgetId": 2512666,
        "text": "## DEX Liquidity\n\nLiquidity and trading activity across XNET pools on Solana.",
        "position": {
          "col": 0,
          "row": 196,
          "sizeX": 6,
          "sizeY": 3
        }
      },
      {
        "widgetId": 2512663,
        "text": "### Revenue Settlement · 60 / 20 / 20\n\nFor every $100 received: **$60 to Buy & Burn · $20 to liquidity · $20 to OpCo.** Half of the current liquidity allocation ($10) buys XNET on the market, bringing the **effective market-buy allocation to 70%**. The liquidity allocation supports trading liquidity; it is not added to the burn total.",
        "position": {
          "col": 0,
          "row": 104,
          "sizeX": 6,
          "sizeY": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "widgetId": 2512665,
        "text": "## Supply & Ownership\n\nXNET emissions, circulating supply and holder distribution.",
        "position": {
          "col": 0,
          "row": 157,
          "sizeX": 6,
          "sizeY": 3
        }
      },
      {
