      {
        "widgetId": 2512661,
        "text": "## Network Activity\n\nCarrier offload, device growth and network productivity. Newly deployed devices can take time to complete carrier approval and begin offloading traffic.",
        "position": {
          "col": 0,
          "row": 33,
          "sizeX": 6,
