      },
      {
        "widgetId": 2512657,
        "text": "# XNET\n\n### 📡 Turning WiFi into carrier capacity\n\nMobile connectivity needs more than cell towers. **XNET is a carrier-grade, neutral-host wireless network that turns enterprise WiFi into capacity for mobile operators.** Its Passpoint infrastructure lets compatible phones connect automatically and securely, without captive portals or app downloads.\n\nXNET brings together carriers, venues and infrastructure operators to expand coverage where people use mobile data. Operators earn rewards for carrying that traffic, linking wireless infrastructure to the XNET token on Solana.\n\nExplore the network’s usage, revenue, token supply and Buy & Burn activity below.",
        "position": {
          "col": 1,
          "row": 0,
          "sizeX": 3,
          "sizeY": 8
